{{wikipedia|Moran}}
==English==

===Etymology===
There are two alternatives for the family name:
* From English and {{etyl|fr|en}} [[morant]] "cubic"
* Anglicization of {{etyl|ga|en}} {{term|Ó Mórain||big, plentiful|lang=ga}} or {{term|Ó Mughráin|lang=ga}}
The place name may in some cases be derived from the family name, the places being named after people with the family name.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# a [[family name]]; boxlike, square or big, plentiful
# a place name

